# 12. Strategic Design Principles

The competitive research translates into the following principles for SkyPath.

## Principle 01 — Compare Meaningfully

Do not simply provide more flight options.

Help users understand the differences between them.

---

## Principle 02 — Make Cost Transparent

The user should understand the effective cost before payment.

---

## Principle 03 — Preserve Context

The selected itinerary should remain accessible throughout the booking process.

---

## Principle 04 — Reduce Repetition

Previously provided traveller information should be reusable whenever appropriate.

---

## Principle 05 — Separate Required and Optional Decisions

The booking journey should clearly distinguish what is necessary from what is additional.

---

## Principle 06 — Support Flexibility

Flexible dates and alternative options should be available without overwhelming users.

---

## Principle 07 — Prevent Errors Early

The system should identify potential mistakes before the final payment stage.

---

## Principle 08 — Design Beyond Confirmation

The booking should remain accessible and useful after the transaction.

